### Register
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jhone Doe",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "@Jhondoe123",
  "confirmPassword": "@Jhondoe123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "@Jhondoe123"
}

### Change Password
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword":"@Jhondoe123",
  "newPassword":"@Jhondoe321",
  "confirmPassword":"@Jhondoe321"
}

### Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Reset Password
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "token": "58147610b195f1e7304aa28ce57d86c87f87ebc7abce5aee2bf6b76f53ad553a",
  "newPassword": "@Jhondoe321",
  "confirmPassword": "@Jhondoe321"
}